recommend keep-going ALES29 — carry the two-sided insert into stereo (both channels, both seams, in lockstep — the twin of ALES27), offer a multi-slot clipboard rack, or let the graft/paste join rather than butt by default. The ALES0 wire seam and the real sound-card write stay Keaton's word.
